WEBVTT

00:25.880 --> 00:28.251
Here's the Americano you ordered.

00:28.275 --> 00:29.427
Enjoy.

00:53.249 --> 00:54.228
Sorry.

00:54.252 --> 00:55.644
I'm sorry.

01:35.985 --> 01:37.239
HAN EUN-JI SENT YOU A VIDEO

01:37.263 --> 01:39.617
HAN EUN-JI:
JUN-HUI, IS THIS YOU? OH MY GOD...

01:59.809 --> 02:01.815
WHO ARE YOU TALKING TO?
ARE YOU IGNORING ME?

02:01.839 --> 02:03.976
REPORTING ME WON'T GET RID OF THE VIDEOS

02:04.000 --> 02:08.455
IT'S OVER FOR YOU, YOU SLUT

03:39.253 --> 03:40.214
Sorry.

03:40.238 --> 03:43.023
We've closed for the day.
I'll give you your order to go.

03:43.381 --> 03:44.381
Sorry.

03:47.486 --> 03:49.384
I think

03:51.245 --> 03:54.092
you dropped these earlier.

03:54.720 --> 03:56.686
They aren't mine.

03:59.442 --> 04:01.273
I'll leave them here

04:01.391 --> 04:03.289
since I found them here.

04:43.125 --> 04:44.210
SOCIAL

04:44.234 --> 04:45.250
SEX

04:45.274 --> 04:47.223
SECRET

04:48.466 --> 04:49.833
SEX LINE

04:49.857 --> 04:52.353
S LINE

04:52.377 --> 04:57.075
RED LINES THAT CONNECT SEXUAL PARTNERS

05:15.708 --> 05:16.907
I'm late, aren't I?

05:20.713 --> 05:21.960
Is something wrong?

05:22.890 --> 05:24.137
Oh, I almost forgot.

05:25.468 --> 05:29.113
Happy birthday.
It's before midnight, but still.

05:30.640 --> 05:32.894
I was going to throw you an awesome party.

05:38.106 --> 05:39.209
I want to...

05:39.941 --> 05:41.764
ask you a favor.

05:44.487 --> 05:45.782
What is it?

05:46.364 --> 05:49.434
You can say no if you want.

06:29.700 --> 06:30.803
I'm not sure

06:32.245 --> 06:34.307
if this is okay.

06:37.708 --> 06:39.915
I don't want to push you into anything.

06:42.422 --> 06:43.525
I just...

06:45.049 --> 06:47.543
If I were ever to be with someone,

06:49.304 --> 06:52.134
I wanted it to be you.

06:58.813 --> 07:00.444
I have a question.

07:01.191 --> 07:02.342
What is it?

07:05.821 --> 07:07.116
Do you like me?

07:13.662 --> 07:14.765
Yes.

07:22.880 --> 07:24.750
Oh, no.

07:25.716 --> 07:27.203
I don't have... that.

07:41.065 --> 07:42.168
You mean this?

08:49.635 --> 08:50.882
It's amazing.

08:53.931 --> 08:55.178
It is.

09:23.753 --> 09:25.000
What's wrong?

09:27.340 --> 09:28.491
Nothing.

09:29.676 --> 09:32.218
Are you hungry?
Should we get something to eat?

09:32.762 --> 09:33.913
Sure.

09:35.682 --> 09:38.320
Except the last bus home
is going to be here soon.

09:39.227 --> 09:40.954
Well...

09:42.606 --> 09:43.666
Wait here for a minute.

09:43.690 --> 09:44.793
Okay.

12:18.098 --> 12:21.456
I've always thought of myself
as a cursed child.

12:23.395 --> 12:25.122
A kid who let her parents die.

12:27.900 --> 12:29.818
I wanted to change.

12:32.112 --> 12:33.311
But...

12:34.156 --> 12:36.075
I couldn't.

12:39.203 --> 12:40.834
I'm cursed.

12:42.206 --> 12:43.885
Anyone close to me

12:45.709 --> 12:47.244
will die.

13:39.306 --> 13:40.450
UNKNOWN NUMBER

13:40.474 --> 13:44.078
HAPPY SEVENTEENTH BIRTHDAY!

13:44.102 --> 13:49.906
YOU ARE INVITED TO THE ROOM OF BOUNDARIES.

13:59.159 --> 14:00.407
Detective...

14:02.663 --> 14:04.006
I need your help.

14:16.052 --> 14:17.299
Did you really not know

14:19.222 --> 14:20.517
about Seon-a's S line?

14:25.395 --> 14:26.594
If I had known,

14:28.523 --> 14:29.962
I would have told you.

14:42.954 --> 14:44.057
I always get

14:47.083 --> 14:48.379
a birthday card

14:49.878 --> 14:51.365
on my birthday.

14:53.632 --> 14:55.359
There's no one to send me one.

14:57.306 --> 14:59.609
I thought it was my mom at first,

15:01.723 --> 15:03.306
but then I realized

15:05.561 --> 15:07.911
someone was counting down the days
until my birthday.

15:13.903 --> 15:16.349
Someday, I would be required
to do something.

15:20.618 --> 15:21.721
And...

15:25.831 --> 15:27.606
I think today is that day.

15:38.761 --> 15:40.281
HAPPY SEVENTEENTH BIRTHDAY!

15:40.305 --> 15:43.182
YOU ARE INVITED TO THE ROOM OF BOUNDARIES.

15:48.229 --> 15:49.620
They lured you to the school,

15:51.316 --> 15:53.043
gave me these glasses,

15:53.610 --> 15:54.953
and Seon-a...

16:05.705 --> 16:07.720
You're saying it's the same person?

16:30.022 --> 16:32.948
A HAPPY AND WISE SCHOOL LIFE FOR EVERYONE

16:34.109 --> 16:36.316
Will there be anyone at school
so late at night?

16:36.570 --> 16:38.490
I ran a background check
on your homeroom teacher,

16:38.514 --> 16:39.675
but nothing came up.

16:39.699 --> 16:42.097
Lee Gyu-jin doesn't exist.

16:42.326 --> 16:44.805
Going to the school premises
and looking for--

16:44.829 --> 16:47.131
Detective, over there!

17:18.822 --> 17:20.165
Hey, Sunglasses!

17:39.259 --> 17:40.459
I almost died.

17:40.908 --> 17:43.354
What happened? Who did this?

17:44.181 --> 17:46.052
You told me to come to school.

17:49.576 --> 17:51.686
But I can't remember after that...

17:55.025 --> 17:56.608
Did something happen to you?

17:59.196 --> 18:00.827
No time for that.

18:01.574 --> 18:02.676
What?

18:02.700 --> 18:04.187
We need to get out of here.

18:04.702 --> 18:06.381
I came with Detective Han.

18:21.177 --> 18:22.177
Detective.

18:26.224 --> 18:27.327
Detective!

18:29.602 --> 18:30.802
Come on.

18:34.566 --> 18:35.813
What the hell?

18:47.329 --> 18:50.159
Wait, didn't we just come downstairs?

18:50.666 --> 18:52.249
Christ. Let's go.

19:04.847 --> 19:07.725
What's happening?
Why are we still on the same floor?

19:10.144 --> 19:12.830
Help us!

19:14.982 --> 19:16.133
I think

19:16.817 --> 19:19.264
we're trapped in here.

19:20.655 --> 19:21.902
Trapped?

19:23.241 --> 19:24.344
What do you mean?

19:37.380 --> 19:40.882
NO ENTRY

19:46.890 --> 19:48.041
The roof.

19:51.186 --> 19:52.529
What?

19:56.233 --> 19:57.576
There's nobody here.

20:07.536 --> 20:09.023
Hello?

20:12.624 --> 20:14.447
Anyone here?

20:49.203 --> 20:51.122
The fact I met her

20:52.081 --> 20:53.520
was a stroke of sheer luck.

20:55.543 --> 20:56.742
I think

20:57.504 --> 20:59.950
you dropped these earlier.

21:10.100 --> 21:13.745
Did you give me these on purpose?

21:14.688 --> 21:16.606
How do you feel right now?

21:17.607 --> 21:18.711
What?

21:20.485 --> 21:22.116
Do you still want to die?

21:24.239 --> 21:25.390
Or...

21:28.786 --> 21:30.129
Do you want to kill?

21:33.666 --> 21:35.200
I don't understand.

21:36.335 --> 21:37.774
The lines above people's heads.

21:39.380 --> 21:41.154
You know what they mean, don't you?

21:43.248 --> 21:44.879
Don't you want to get rid of them?

21:48.607 --> 21:49.950
The red lines.

21:51.559 --> 21:55.204
Others will be able to see
the world you see with these glasses.

21:55.396 --> 21:56.835
It won't be long.

21:56.904 --> 21:58.582
And no one will need glasses.

22:01.319 --> 22:05.876
Aren't you excited to find out
what people will do

22:06.991 --> 22:08.238
when that day comes?

22:10.203 --> 22:13.417
For some,
it'll be a conspicuous weak point,

22:14.165 --> 22:17.139
and others will try to use that.

22:17.502 --> 22:18.701
Which is why

22:20.755 --> 22:21.907
I came

22:24.843 --> 22:27.289
to help you, Jun-hui.

22:30.098 --> 22:31.345
After that,

22:33.185 --> 22:35.871
I found a new purpose in life.

23:14.435 --> 23:15.634
I am now ready

23:16.312 --> 23:18.806
to sever my last sin from myself.

23:19.440 --> 23:22.078
On the day the world turns red,

23:22.819 --> 23:24.066
we will all

23:25.109 --> 23:27.747
be born again!

23:33.252 --> 23:34.252
Please...

23:35.593 --> 23:37.175
I'm sorry.

23:37.459 --> 23:39.329
Don't do this.

23:39.711 --> 23:42.659
You know how much I love...

24:17.473 --> 24:18.577
Gyeong-jin.

24:23.566 --> 24:26.206
There's something I haven't told you.

24:30.703 --> 24:31.855
I could see strange things

24:33.708 --> 24:36.251
ever since I was little.

24:37.297 --> 24:38.449
Are you calling this...

24:41.804 --> 24:43.052
strange?

24:54.867 --> 24:56.163
I think it's awesome.

24:58.415 --> 24:59.854
Where did you get those?

25:01.336 --> 25:02.872
- Take them off--
- No.

25:05.927 --> 25:07.223
By the way...

25:08.723 --> 25:11.891
I heard S lines will be visible
even without glasses if you die.

25:13.230 --> 25:14.382
Is it true?

25:16.027 --> 25:17.178
What?

25:18.405 --> 25:20.229
That's what our homeroom teacher said.

25:21.535 --> 25:22.687
Our homeroom teacher?

26:02.143 --> 26:03.295
Lee Gyu-jin.

26:54.979 --> 26:56.033
Father.

27:19.444 --> 27:21.313
Don't you want to save Seon-a?

28:18.250 --> 28:19.544
No!

28:38.589 --> 28:39.739
Put the knife down.

28:41.298 --> 28:43.263
I said, put it down!

28:53.593 --> 28:54.743
Detective.

28:56.010 --> 28:58.072
How was the world with the glasses on?

28:59.305 --> 29:00.840
Wasn't it beautiful?

29:02.809 --> 29:04.343
It won't be long

29:05.228 --> 29:09.736
until the whole world is bathed in red.

29:16.280 --> 29:18.439
Regular human beings cannot kill me.

29:27.458 --> 29:29.857
Was it you
that pushed Seon-a off the roof?

29:30.920 --> 29:32.839
If Seon-a weren't at the hospital,

29:33.464 --> 29:35.671
would you have even cared
to give her a glance?

29:37.176 --> 29:39.815
I gave you an opportunity.

29:54.736 --> 29:55.887
Die!

30:02.535 --> 30:03.926
No!

30:26.351 --> 30:27.502
Where am I?

30:33.775 --> 30:35.022
Your face...

30:38.738 --> 30:40.513
Why have your eyes changed color?

31:35.045 --> 31:36.244
Stop it!

31:56.483 --> 31:58.258
Why are you doing this?

32:08.245 --> 32:10.260
Haven't you always wondered

32:11.582 --> 32:15.755
why you were able to see
the red lines from birth?

32:17.963 --> 32:19.882
It was all for today, Hyeon-heup.

32:21.634 --> 32:23.216
You're not cursed,

32:23.594 --> 32:26.088
but a present and blessing.

32:26.159 --> 32:27.693
That's a lie.

32:31.685 --> 32:33.460
People killing each other,

32:37.066 --> 32:38.793
having my friends and family die...

32:39.568 --> 32:41.343
Knowing what I've been through,

32:44.198 --> 32:46.308
how can you say
seeing S lines is a blessing?

32:47.493 --> 32:49.028
People want to know.

33:04.260 --> 33:05.843
Don't you get it, Hyeon-heup?

33:07.054 --> 33:08.206
S lines.

33:09.640 --> 33:13.286
Can't you feel the desire
of the people who are craving to see them?

33:13.561 --> 33:16.055
I'm a mere mouthpiece for their longing.

34:28.261 --> 34:29.508
Mom...

34:31.222 --> 34:32.422
I'm sorry.

34:37.103 --> 34:38.398
I'm sorry...

34:40.231 --> 34:42.390
I'm so late.

34:49.449 --> 34:50.648
I had...

34:53.578 --> 34:55.641
the glasses too.

34:56.998 --> 34:58.601
- Hey, you're here.
- Hey.

34:58.625 --> 35:00.112
Have you eaten?

35:03.839 --> 35:05.421
What's wrong, honey?

35:12.431 --> 35:13.726
Hyeon-heup...

35:14.307 --> 35:15.794
it's not your fault.

35:40.417 --> 35:41.417
You!

37:24.564 --> 37:25.811
Your death

37:27.275 --> 37:31.448
will bring to mankind
the blessed eyes of God.

39:35.487 --> 39:36.638
You're too late.

39:39.075 --> 39:40.274
I've already

39:41.995 --> 39:44.250
proven the reason for your existence.

39:45.791 --> 39:47.038
The two of us

39:50.004 --> 39:51.923
have finished what we're here to do.

40:10.529 --> 40:12.880
- What's going on?
- What's happening?

40:52.454 --> 40:53.606
My glasses.

41:36.799 --> 41:37.951
Hyeon-heup.

41:40.345 --> 41:41.545
Are you all right?

41:45.894 --> 41:47.860
Let's get out of here.

41:56.156 --> 41:57.259
Detective.

42:09.088 --> 42:10.191
Detective.

42:20.393 --> 42:22.120
Let's go and see Seon-a.

42:33.242 --> 42:34.470
It's awesome.

42:34.494 --> 42:36.055
Cool.

42:36.079 --> 42:37.662
The sky's turned red.

42:48.010 --> 42:49.161
Look above his head!

43:02.360 --> 43:03.608
Get it off me!

43:04.238 --> 43:05.821
- What the hell?
- Look!

43:08.534 --> 43:10.693
Look, your head!

43:12.289 --> 43:13.558
- Do I have them too?
- A lot.

43:13.582 --> 43:15.227
- What?
- Look.

43:15.251 --> 43:16.562
What is that?

43:16.586 --> 43:17.833
What are they?

43:29.727 --> 43:30.974
Someday,

43:31.604 --> 43:35.010
everyone will see the world as you do.

43:59.512 --> 44:01.815
A world where everyone can see S lines.

44:02.432 --> 44:06.798
I finally got to be what I wanted.
A regular human being.

44:08.064 --> 44:12.958
The world was in a state
of massive chaos for almost a year.

44:13.821 --> 44:17.179
People tried to figure out
why S lines suddenly appeared,

44:17.534 --> 44:19.262
but no one could find the answer.

44:19.286 --> 44:24.435
GOOD LUCK ON THE NEXT CHAPTER OF YOUR LIFE

44:24.459 --> 44:26.666
Seon-a eventually awoke from her coma.

44:28.422 --> 44:30.821
In a world full of S lines,

44:31.718 --> 44:34.692
she was reborn without one.

44:36.849 --> 44:38.048
See you.

44:39.310 --> 44:42.524
Seon-a and Detective Han
didn't ask each other any questions.

44:44.274 --> 44:45.474
They were just relieved

44:46.193 --> 44:48.736
at the fact that each other was alive.

44:49.114 --> 44:51.080
I told you not to come.

44:51.408 --> 44:52.847
What do you want for lunch?

44:53.160 --> 44:55.559
Nothing.
It's embarrassing to eat with you.

44:55.997 --> 44:57.964
What are you talking about?

44:58.667 --> 45:00.538
Just look above your own head.

45:00.794 --> 45:02.189
Didn't you see everyone?

45:02.213 --> 45:04.132
They're all staring at you.

45:05.796 --> 45:06.947
And as for me...

45:09.263 --> 45:10.990
I was on my own again.

45:32.332 --> 45:38.425
YOO JUN-SEON

45:45.223 --> 45:48.996
YOO JUN-SEON

46:14.091 --> 46:15.242
Hyeon-heup.

46:43.918 --> 46:45.117
Hyeon-heup.

47:07.029 --> 47:08.180
Hyeon-heup.
